1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A green summary cannot tell you what was checked.

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:17,000
Mattermost carries the conversation. Switch connects it to Codex.

3
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Actual human handoff in the existing room. Private details masked.

4
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:36,000
Codex verified the recorded patch review before proceeding.

5
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,000
The original candidate had four independent defects.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:50,000
The evidence was valid. The candidate was blocked.

7
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:57,000
The human reviewed the criteria and tests, then the separate patch.

8
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:04,000
The correction changed four inputs. The six tests stayed fixed.

9
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The defective checkout has no visible email label.

10
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:16,000
The corrected checkout restores the label. Same synthetic fixture.

11
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:24,000
The real corrected report shows all four checks passing.

12
00:01:24,000 --> 00:01:32,000
The new frozen snapshot has valid evidence and zero blockers.

13
00:01:32,000 --> 00:01:45,000
Four verified results make the candidate ready for human review.

14
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:51,000
The final decision was recorded separately by a human.

15
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:57,000
Level 1 is manual identity. The effective decision later expired.

16
00:01:57,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Readiness does not authorize a production release.

17
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:11,000
GitHub Actions passed all seven jobs on the published implementation.

18
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:19,000
The Windows setup pins the tools and documents reproduction.

19
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:32,000
Inspect the source, run the checks, and review the evidence.
